# Week 11 requests reconstructed from the supplied slides.
# Run reset.sql first, then execute 1-82 in order.

### 1. List all rooms (expect 200, 3 rooms)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rooms

### 2. Filter by capacity (expect 2 rooms)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rooms?minCapacity=6

### 3. Filter by keyword (expect 1 room)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rooms?keyword=pod

### 4. Both filters (expect 1 room)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rooms?minCapacity=6&keyword=roof

### 5. One room (expect 200)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/2

### 6. Missing room (expect 404)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/99

### 7. Create (expect 201 + Location: /api/rooms/4)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms
Authorization: Basic YWRtaW46YWRtaW4xMjM0
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Rooftop", "capacity": 12 }

### 8. Replace (expect 200)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/4
Authorization: Basic YWRtaW46YWRtaW4xMjM0
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Roof", "capacity": 10 }

### 9. Replace missing room (expect 404)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/99
Authorization: Basic YWRtaW46YWRtaW4xMjM0
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Ghost", "capacity": 5 }

### 10. Delete (expect 204)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/4
Authorization: Basic YWRtaW46YWRtaW4xMjM0

### 11. Delete again (expect 404)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/4
Authorization: Basic YWRtaW46YWRtaW4xMjM0

### 12. Capacity 0 is rejected (expect 400)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms
Authorization: Basic YWRtaW46YWRtaW4xMjM0
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Closet", "capacity": 0 }

### 13. Capacity 50 is rejected (expect 400)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/1
Authorization: Basic YWRtaW46YWRtaW4xMjM0
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Seminar A", "capacity": 50 }

### 14. Stats: another controller sees the same data (expect {"rooms": 3})
GET http://localhost:8080/api/stats

### 15. Reservations of room 1, ordered by start (expect 200, 3 owners: mina, omar, omar)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/1/reservations

### 16. Reservations of a missing room (expect 404)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/99/reservations

### 17. Book room 1 (expect 201 + Location: /api/reservations/6)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/1/reservations
Authorization: Basic bWluYTptaW5hMTIzNA==
Content-Type: application/json

{ "startTime": "2026-10-14T10:00:00", "endTime": "2026-10-14T11:00:00" }

### 18. Overlaps Mina's 10:00-11:00 on 6 October (expect 409)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/1/reservations
Authorization: Basic bWluYTptaW5hMTIzNA==
Content-Type: application/json

{ "startTime": "2026-10-06T10:30:00", "endTime": "2026-10-06T11:30:00" }

### 19. Starts exactly when Mina's ends: touching is not overlapping (expect 201 + /api/reservations/7)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/1/reservations
Authorization: Basic bWluYTptaW5hMTIzNA==
Content-Type: application/json

{ "startTime": "2026-10-06T11:00:00", "endTime": "2026-10-06T12:00:00" }

### 20. End before start (expect 400)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/1/reservations
Authorization: Basic bWluYTptaW5hMTIzNA==
Content-Type: application/json

{ "startTime": "2026-10-15T12:00:00", "endTime": "2026-10-15T11:00:00" }

### 21. Book a missing room (expect 404)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/99/reservations
Authorization: Basic bWluYTptaW5hMTIzNA==
Content-Type: application/json

{ "startTime": "2026-10-15T10:00:00", "endTime": "2026-10-15T11:00:00" }

### 22. My reservations with room names (expect 200, ids 3, 1, 7, 6)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reservations/mine
Authorization: Basic bWluYTptaW5hMTIzNA==

### 23. Delete a room that has reservations (expect 409)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/1
Authorization: Basic YWRtaW46YWRtaW4xMjM0

### 24. Read reservation 7 as its owner (expect 200, owner mina)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reservations/7
Authorization: Basic bWluYTptaW5hMTIzNA==

### 25. Cancel reservation 7 as its owner (expect 204)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/reservations/7
Authorization: Basic bWluYTptaW5hMTIzNA==

### 26. Same values again (expect 200; console: one select, no update)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/2
Authorization: Basic YWRtaW46YWRtaW4xMjM0
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Study Pod", "capacity": 4 }

### 27. New values (expect 200; console: select, then update)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/2
Authorization: Basic YWRtaW46YWRtaW4xMjM0
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Study Pod XL", "capacity": 6 }

### 28. Blank name (expect 400, fieldErrors: name)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms
Authorization: Basic YWRtaW46YWRtaW4xMjM0
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "", "capacity": 5 }

### 29. Capacity 0 (expect 400, fieldErrors: capacity)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms
Authorization: Basic YWRtaW46YWRtaW4xMjM0
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Closet", "capacity": 0 }

### 30. Two bad fields (expect 400, two fieldErrors)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms
Authorization: Basic YWRtaW46YWRtaW4xMjM0
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "", "capacity": 50 }

### 31. Missing room (expect 404, message "room 99 not found")
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/99

### 32. Room with reservations (expect 409, message "room 1 has reservations")
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/1
Authorization: Basic YWRtaW46YWRtaW4xMjM0

### 33. A URL that does not exist (expect 404, not 500)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/nothing

### 34. A client cannot choose the owner (expect 201 + Location: /api/reservations/8, owner mina)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/1/reservations
Authorization: Basic bWluYTptaW5hMTIzNA==
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reservedBy": "omar", "owner": "omar", "ownerId": 2, "startTime": "2026-11-02T10:00:00", "endTime": "2026-11-02T11:00:00" }

### 35. Missing endTime (expect 400, fieldErrors: endTime)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/1/reservations
Authorization: Basic bWluYTptaW5hMTIzNA==
Content-Type: application/json

{ "startTime": "2026-11-02T10:00:00" }

### 36. End before start (expect 400, message "startTime must be before endTime")
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/1/reservations
Authorization: Basic bWluYTptaW5hMTIzNA==
Content-Type: application/json

{ "startTime": "2026-11-02T12:00:00", "endTime": "2026-11-02T11:00:00" }

### 37. Overlaps Mina (expect 409, message "room 1 is already booked at that time")
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/1/reservations
Authorization: Basic bWluYTptaW5hMTIzNA==
Content-Type: application/json

{ "startTime": "2026-10-06T10:30:00", "endTime": "2026-10-06T11:30:00" }

### 38. Missing reservation (expect 404, message "reservation 99 not found")
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reservations/99
Authorization: Basic bWluYTptaW5hMTIzNA==

### 39. Old search endpoint was removed (expect 404)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reservations
Authorization: Basic bWluYTptaW5hMTIzNA==

### 40. Not a number (expect 400, "request body is missing or is not valid JSON")
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms
Authorization: Basic YWRtaW46YWRtaW4xMjM0
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Lab", "capacity": "ten" }

### 41. Not an id (expect 400, "'id' has the wrong type")
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/abc

### 42. Create a room without login (expect 401, message "login required")
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Library", "capacity": 6 }

### 43. Sign up lee (expect 201, id, username and role only)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "lee", "password": "lee12345" }

### 44. Duplicate username (expect 409, message "username lee is taken")
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "lee", "password": "lee12345" }

### 45. Invalid username and short password (expect 400, two fieldErrors)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "Lee!", "password": "short" }

### 46. Lee cannot create a room using Basic (expect 403, message "admin role required")
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms
Authorization: Basic bGVlOmxlZTEyMzQ1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Library", "capacity": 6 }

### 47. Wrong Basic password (expect 401, message "wrong username or password")
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms
Authorization: Basic bGVlOndyb25ncGFzc3dvcmQ=
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Library", "capacity": 6 }

### 48. Public room list (expect 200, 3 rooms)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rooms

### 49. Current user with Basic (expect 200, lee with ROLE_USER)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/auth/me
Authorization: Basic bGVlOmxlZTEyMzQ1

### 50. Login and save the token (expect 200, accessToken, tokenType and expiresIn)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "lee", "password": "lee12345" }

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.accessToken); %}

### 51. Wrong login password (expect 401, message "wrong username or password")
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "lee", "password": "wrongpassword" }

### 52. Current user with JWT (expect 200, lee with ROLE_USER)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 53. Lee cannot create a room using JWT (expect 403, message "admin role required")
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Meeting Room", "capacity": 8 }

### 54. Create with a broken token (expect 401, message "token is invalid or expired")
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms
Authorization: Bearer broken.token.signature
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Meeting Room", "capacity": 8 }

### 55. Public reading with a broken token (expect 401, message "token is invalid or expired")
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rooms
Authorization: Bearer broken.token.signature

### 56. Reservations without login (expect 401, message "login required")
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reservations/mine

### 57. Signup cannot choose ADMIN (expect 201, role USER)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "alice", "password": "alice1234", "role": "ADMIN" }

### 58. Login as admin (expect 200, saves adminToken)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "admin", "password": "admin1234" }

> {% client.global.set("adminToken", response.body.accessToken); %}

### 59. Admin token has ROLE_ADMIN (expect 200)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 60. Admin creates room 5 (expect 201 + Location: /api/rooms/5)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Library", "capacity": 6 }

### 61. Mina cannot create rooms (expect 403, message "admin role required")
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms
Authorization: Basic bWluYTptaW5hMTIzNA==
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Forbidden Room", "capacity": 4 }

### 62. Lee's token cannot change a room (expect 403, message "admin role required")
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/5
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Forbidden Change", "capacity": 4 }

### 63. Deleting a room without login (expect 401, message "login required")
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/5

### 64. Mina books room 5 (expect 201 + Location: /api/reservations/9, owner mina)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/5/reservations
Authorization: Basic bWluYTptaW5hMTIzNA==
Content-Type: application/json

{ "startTime": "2026-11-03T10:00:00", "endTime": "2026-11-03T11:00:00" }

### 65. Admin cannot delete a booked room (expect 409, message "room 5 has reservations")
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/5
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 66. Mina sees her bookings (expect 200, ids 3, 1, 6, 8, 9 in this order)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reservations/mine
Authorization: Basic bWluYTptaW5hMTIzNA==

### 67. Omar sees his bookings (expect 200, ids 2, 4, 5 in this order)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reservations/mine
Authorization: Basic b21hcjpvbWFyMTIzNA==

### 68. Omar cannot read Mina's booking (expect 403, message "reservation 9 belongs to another user")
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reservations/9
Authorization: Basic b21hcjpvbWFyMTIzNA==

### 69. Admin can read Mina's booking (expect 200, owner mina)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reservations/9
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 70. Omar cannot cancel Mina's booking (expect 403, message "reservation 9 belongs to another user")
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/reservations/9
Authorization: Basic b21hcjpvbWFyMTIzNA==

### 71. Missing reservation is checked before ownership (expect 404, message "reservation 99 not found")
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reservations/99
Authorization: Basic b21hcjpvbWFyMTIzNA==

### 72. Mina moves her booking (expect 200, 14:00 to 15:00)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/reservations/9
Authorization: Basic bWluYTptaW5hMTIzNA==
Content-Type: application/json

{ "startTime": "2026-11-03T14:00:00", "endTime": "2026-11-03T15:00:00" }

### 73. Same time again does not overlap itself (expect 200)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/reservations/9
Authorization: Basic bWluYTptaW5hMTIzNA==
Content-Type: application/json

{ "startTime": "2026-11-03T14:00:00", "endTime": "2026-11-03T15:00:00" }

### 74. Omar cannot move Mina's booking (expect 403, message "reservation 9 belongs to another user")
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/reservations/9
Authorization: Basic b21hcjpvbWFyMTIzNA==
Content-Type: application/json

{ "startTime": "2026-11-03T16:00:00", "endTime": "2026-11-03T17:00:00" }

### 75. Admin cannot move another owner's booking (expect 403, message "reservation 9 belongs to another user")
