Authorization: Basic bWluYTptaW5hMTIzNA==
Content-Type: application/json

{ "startTime": "2026-10-06T10:30:00", "endTime": "2026-10-06T11:30:00" }

### 77. End before start (expect 400, message "startTime must be before endTime")
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/reservations/9
Authorization: Basic bWluYTptaW5hMTIzNA==
Content-Type: application/json

{ "startTime": "2026-11-03T16:00:00", "endTime": "2026-11-03T15:00:00" }

### 78. Move a missing booking (expect 404, message "reservation 99 not found")
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/reservations/99
Authorization: Basic bWluYTptaW5hMTIzNA==
Content-Type: application/json

{ "startTime": "2026-11-03T14:00:00", "endTime": "2026-11-03T15:00:00" }

### 79. Admin cancels Mina's booking (expect 204)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/reservations/9
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 80. Admin deletes the now-empty room (expect 204)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/5
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 81. Allowed CORS preflight (expect 200, Access-Control-Allow-Origin: http://localhost:5500)
OPTIONS http://localhost:8080/api/rooms
Origin: http://localhost:5500
Access-Control-Request-Method: POST
Access-Control-Request-Headers: Authorization, Content-Type

### 82. Disallowed CORS preflight (expect 403, plain text "Invalid CORS request")
OPTIONS http://localhost:8080/api/rooms
Origin: https://untrusted.example
Access-Control-Request-Method: POST
Access-Control-Request-Headers: Authorization, Content-Type
